{
	"info": {
		"name": "Tiqani v3 — Phase 12: Media Storage",
		"description": "Media storage configuration and upload validators. Tests local vs S3 storage, file validation, and sensitive file exposure hardening.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://127.0.0.1:8000"
		},
		{
			"key": "admin_token",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "dealership_token",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "finance_token",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "access_token",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "guarantee_id",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "recharge_id",
			"value": ""
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Health & Storage Check",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Health Check",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/health/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "health"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Check Media Storage (CLI)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/health/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "health"]
						},
						"description": "Run locally: python manage.py check_media_storage"
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Admin Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', jsonData.access);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n\t\"username\": \"admin_demo\",\n\t\"password\": \"AdminDemo123!\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Dealership Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"pm.collectionVariables.set('dealership_token', jsonData.access);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n\t\"username\": \"dealership_demo\",\n\t\"password\": \"DealershipDemo123!\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
						}
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "3. Upload Examples (multipart/form-data)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Upload Guarantee Document",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{admin_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{ "key": "cash_amount", "value": "5000000", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "document_file", "type": "file", "src": "" }
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/admin/dealerships/{{guarantee_id}}/guarantees/create/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "admin", "dealerships", "{{guarantee_id}}", "guarantees", "create"]
						},
						"description": "Upload a PDF or image document. Max 10 MB. Allowed: pdf, jpg, jpeg, png."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Upload Recharge Proof",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{dealership_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{ "key": "client_id", "value": "", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "fee_mode", "value": "added_on_top", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "wallet_credit_amount", "value": "50000", "type": "text" },
								{ "key": "proof_file", "type": "file", "src": "" }
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/dealership/recharges/create/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "dealership", "recharges", "create"]
						},
						"description": "Upload a proof file (PDF or image) with a recharge. Max 5 MB."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Upload Profile Image (Multipart)",
					"request": {
						"method": "PATCH",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "multipart/form-data" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{ "key": "profile_image", "type": "file", "src": "" }
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/accounts/me/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "accounts", "me"]
						},
						"description": "Upload a profile image. Max 2 MB. Allowed: jpg, jpeg, png, webp."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "4. Notes",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Important Notes",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/health/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "health"]
						},
						"description": "## Upload Notes\n\n1. Use multipart/form-data for file uploads.\n2. Max file sizes are enforced server-side:\n   - Profile images: 2 MB\n   - Category icons: 1 MB\n   - Documents: 10 MB\n   - Proof files: 5 MB\n\n3. Allowed extensions:\n   - Images: jpg, jpeg, png, webp\n   - Documents: pdf, jpg, jpeg, png\n   - Proof files: pdf, jpg, jpeg, png, webp\n\n4. Blocked types:\n   - Executables (.exe, .bat, .sh)\n   - Archives (.zip, .rar, .7z)\n   - Videos (.mp4, .mov, .avi)\n   - Scripts (.js, .html, .svg)\n\n5. File overwrite is disabled.\n\n## Storage Modes\n\n- **Local**: Files stored at MEDIA_ROOT. Use for development.\n- **S3**: Files stored on S3-compatible storage. Signed URLs expire after 900s.\n\nRun `python manage.py check_media_storage` to check current configuration."
					}
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
